From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament_view: use lowest qemu quality

QEMU's llvmpipe path cannot complete the default Ultra view settings within
the software frame budget.  Use the existing Lowest preset so the PoC can
reach a presented frame before restoring production quality settings.

---
 ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
--- a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
+++ b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
@@ -206,1 +206,1 @@ void ViewTarget::setupView(uint32_t width, uint32_t height) {
-  ChangeQualitySettings(ViewTarget::ePredefinedQualitySettings::Ultra);
+  ChangeQualitySettings(ViewTarget::ePredefinedQualitySettings::Lowest);
